55,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A gives us stability, B gives us precision, and C puts the burden on one person.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B sounds like the ""checking figures"" nightmare I discovered. Option A seems more socially sustainable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A guarantees my days, which solves the problem of my weekly trips collapsing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Option B is the only one that is financially fair, though I admit it requires more effort.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A sounds the easiest. No more arranging every single trip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, would you accept A if we adjusted the monthly share to be more equitable?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Option C is too risky; it creates a power imbalance that would likely lead to more friction.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I strongly prefer A. I cannot deal with the uncertainty of a booking calendar every morning.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,"If we go with A, the people who use it less are still subsidizing the heavy users.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"But @Shion, the time we save is worth more to me than a few yen in fuel.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minako,,I agree with Daisuke. The mental load of Option B is too high for this group.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests that the social cost of B outweighs the financial benefit. I vote for A.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am voting for A. It is the only way to ensure the car is where it should be.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I still prefer B for the sake of honesty, but I see the consensus forming.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Minako,,I will also vote for A. It provides the structure we are currently lacking.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
